In article <1991Jul8.003815.25614@en.ecn.purdue.edu> brajesh@en.ecn.purdue.edu (Brajesh K Singh) writes:
>> Also, Dolf mentioned that luckstone effets are cumulative for multiple
>> luckstones. Would someone like to verify/quantify this?
>   From what I hear, luck stones do not add, I may have heard wrong.

Yes and no. The luckstones don't add up, but carrying a blessed and a cursed
luckstone cancel each others effects. At least that what I get from reading
the source code (function 'stone_luck' in 'attrib.c'). Carrying two blessed/
uncursed/cursed luckstones isn't different from carrying one blessed/uncursed/
cursed luckstone.
